OL,3,GNEWSAPart of Brighton's iconic West
OL,4,APier collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of Brighton's West Pier has fallen
OL,7,Finto the sea during the wet and windy
OL,8,Fweather.
OL,10,FIn footage obtained by the BBC, one
OL,11,Fside of the famous landmark can be seen
OL,12,Fcollapsing into the water as it is
OL,13,Fbattered by large waves.
OL,15,FSimon Haffende, who recorded the video,
OL,16,Fsaid he saw a "big wave come along and
OL,17,Fliterally hit the pier".
OL,19,F"You heard the bang of the wave and
OL,20,Fthen... there was a huge crash," he
OL,21,Ftold the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
